sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant S as Servidor
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant O as Outros clientes
    C->>S: POST /api/auth/register
    S->>DB: insere usuário (hash Argon2id)
    S-->>C: 201 (id, username)
    C->>S: POST /api/auth/login
    S->>DB: busca usuário
    S-->>C: 200 (access_token)
    C->>S: GET /ws (Upgrade)
    S-->>C: 101 Switching Protocols
    C->>S: AUTH (token)
    S->>O: PRESENCE_UPDATE (FREE)
    S-->>C: AUTH_OK (user, active_match_id)
    S-->>C: PRESENCE_SNAPSHOT (users)
